  "ingredients": [
    "1 medium cauliflower (head of)",
    "1/2 cup grated parmesan cheese",
    "1/4 cup mozzarella cheese",
    "1 large egg",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "3/4 cup low-carb tomato sauce",
    "1 1/4 cup mozzarella cheese"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Pre-heat oven to 500F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the cauliflower. Cut the cauliflower florets off from the stems.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a food processor, pulse the cauliflower florets until it resembles small crumbles (similar to pieces of rice). If you don’t have a food processor, you can use a knife to finely chop or a grater to finely grate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave the riced cauliflower in a microwave-safe bowl for 4-5 minutes or until slightly softened and cooked.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the cauliflower cool for a few minutes, then squeeze as much liquid out of it as possible. You can use a kitchen towel or cheesecloth to help with this.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the egg, parmesan cheese, mozzarella cheese, and spices. Stir together well until combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread the cauliflower mixture onto a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Bake for 10-15 minutes until lightly golden brown and slightly crispy on the edges.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with tomato sauce and remaining mozzarella cheese. Return to the oven for 5-7 minutes, or alternatively broil the cheese on the pizza for 2-3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/The-best-low-carb-cauliflower-pizza-crust-recipe-19.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and serve!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-pizza-crust/#wprm-recipe-53369-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
